%N A402591 a(n) = 1 if n is squarefree or twice a squarefree number (A005117), otherwise 0.
%H A402591 Antti Karttunen, <a href="/A402591/b402591.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..65537</a>
%H A402591 <a href="/index/Ch#char_fns">Index entries for characteristic functions</a>.
%F A402591 Multiplicative with a(p) = 1, a(p^2) = 1 for p = 2 and 0 for p > 2, and a(p^e) = 0 for e >= 3.
%F A402591 a(n) = [n == A007947(n) or n == 2*A007947(n)], where [ ] is the Iverson bracket.
%F A402591 From _Amiram Eldar_, Nov 25 2026: (Start)
%F A402591 Dirichlet g.f.: (1 + 1/(2^s + 2^(2*s))) * zeta(s) / zeta(2*s).
%F A402591 Asymptotic mean: Limit_{m->oo} (1/m) * Sum_{k=1..m} a(k) = 7/Pi^2. (End)
%t A402591 a[n_] := Boole[SquareFreeQ[n/(2-Mod[n,2])]]; Array[a, 120] (* _Amiram Eldar_, Nov 25 2026 *)
%o A402591 (PARI) A402591(n) = issquarefree(n/(1+!(n%2)));
%Y A402591 Characteristic function of A078779.
%Y A402591 Absolute values of A092152.
